xudanu – Rust/WASM implementation in the Xanadu lineage

This project includes work derived from Udanax Gold (Xanadu 92.1),
originally developed by Autodesk, Inc. and contributors to the
Xanadu project.

Udanax Gold was released under the Xanadu X11 license, a permissive
open-source license.

This repository contains:

* A translation and reinterpretation of Udanax Gold concepts into Rust
  and WebAssembly
* Modifications, optimizations, and new architectural elements

Portions of this project are derived from Udanax Gold and remain
subject to the terms of the Xanadu X11 license.
